source.text:
So if $\Pow{\PosInt}$ were !!{enumerable}, $\Bin^\omega$ would be
!!{enumerable}.  But $\Bin^\omega$ is !!{nonenumerable}
(\olref[nen]{thm:nonenum-bin-omega}). Hence $\Pow{\PosInt}$ is
!!{nonenumerable}.
\end{proof}

